		{
			dependencies: ["53D1CE971F63D842", "804525B795119B1B"]
			description: [
				"Titanium is the way out of HV: nothing in this chapter is built from it, but the EV hull, motor and pump are. For now it comes from the ilmenite in the End's bauxite vein."
				"Chlorine and carbon turn ilmenite into titanium tetrachloride; the Kanthal EBF reduces it with magnesium into a hot ingot, and only the vacuum freezer cools it solid. The magnesium chloride left behind splits back into magnesium and salt with sodium."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:titanium_ingot"
